+---
+id: task-001-implement-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution as the public `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` API.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- An empty pointer returns the complete document.
+- Slash-delimited reference tokens navigate object members and array elements, including RFC 6901
+  `~0` and `~1` decoding.
+- Invalid pointer syntax and references that cannot resolve to a document value throw errors.
+- The exported API has documentation and is covered by automated tests.
